 "html": "<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(48px,7vw,96px);padding-bottom:clamp(48px,6vw,80px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,420px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,72px);align-items:start\"><div><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:#6E6C8A\"><a href=\"/\" style=\"color:#6E6C8A\">Home</a><span>/</span><a href=\"/coverage\" style=\"color:#6E6C8A\">Coverage</a><span>/</span><span style=\"color:#3B2ED3\">Kenya</span></nav><div style=\"margin-top:32px\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/ke.svg\" alt=\"Flag of Kenya\" style=\"width:96px;height:64px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(34px, 2.2vw + 26px, 58px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.045em;font-weight:700;margin:28px 0 0\">Send money to Kenya<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h1><p style=\"font-size:clamp(17px,1.4vw,19px);line-height:1.55;color:#4C4A66;margin:24px 0 0;max-width:50ch\">For businesses paying suppliers, staff and partners. Pay out in KES to M-Pesa, Airtel Money, PesaLink and Bank. Fund from USD, EUR, GBP or the USDC and USDT stablecoins, with the rate shown before you confirm.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px\"><a href=\"/contact\" style=\"padding:16px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff\" class=\"dp-1uxoczp\">Talk to sales</a><a href=\"/payments\" style=\"padding:16px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#F6F4EF;color:#131126\" class=\"dp-1u9awz2\">How payouts work →</a></div><a href=\"/stablecoin-payments-in-kenya\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;margin-top:16px;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\">Stablecoin payments in Kenya for businesses →</a><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;color:#6E6C8A;margin:20px 0 0\">Updated October 2026</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px\"><div style=\"padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#131126;color:#F6F4EF\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B4B1D0\">QUICK ANSWER</div><p style=\"font-size:18px;line-height:28px;margin:12px 0 0\">The fastest way for a business to send money to Kenya is a direct payout to M-Pesa in KES. With ElementPay it is sent on local rails with the rate and fee shown upfront, funded from fiat or stablecoins.</p></div><div style=\"border-radius:24px;background:#F6F4EF;padding:8px;display:grid;gap:4px\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Currency</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">KES · Kenyan shilling</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Payout rails</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">M-Pesa, Airtel Money, PesaLink and Bank</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Typical delivery</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">Around 30 seconds</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Hours</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">Set by each local rail</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Fund with</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">USD, EUR, GBP, USDC, USDT</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">KES account</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\"><a href=\"/open-a-kes-account\">Available →</a></span></div></div></div></section>\n<div style=\"background:#F6F4EF\">\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px);\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px, 1.9vw + 23px, 52px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Payout rails in Kenya.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:32px\"><div style=\"padding:26px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:200px\"><span style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/ke.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:30px;height:21px;border-radius:3px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#EEEDFB;color:#3B2ED3\">Mobile money</span></span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px, 0.9vw + 20px, 34px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em;margin:auto 0 0\">M-Pesa</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Mobile money wallet, paid to the recipient’s phone number.</p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;color:#6E6C8A\">Phone · +254</span></div><div style=\"padding:26px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:200px\"><span style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/ke.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:30px;height:21px;border-radius:3px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#EEEDFB;color:#3B2ED3\">Mobile money</span></span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px, 0.9vw + 20px, 34px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em;margin:auto 0 0\">Airtel Money</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Mobile money wallet, paid to the recipient’s phone number.</p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;color:#6E6C8A\">Phone · +254</span></div><div style=\"padding:26px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:200px\"><span style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/ke.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:30px;height:21px;border-radius:3px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#F6F4EF;color:#4C4A66\">Bank</span></span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px, 0.9vw + 20px, 34px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em;margin:auto 0 0\">PesaLink</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Real-time transfers between Kenyan banks, using the account number and bank.</p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;color:#6E6C8A\">Account number + bank</span></div><div style=\"padding:26px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:200px\"><span style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/ke.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:30px;height:21px;border-radius:3px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#F6F4EF;color:#4C4A66\">Bank</span></span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px, 0.9vw + 20px, 34px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em;margin:auto 0 0\">Bank</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Local bank transfer to accounts in Kenya.</p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;color:#6E6C8A\">Account number + bank</span></div><a href=\"/stablecoins\" style=\"padding:26px;border-radius:24px;background:#131126;color:#F6F4EF;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:200px\" class=\"dp-1uxoczp\"><span style=\"display:flex;gap:6px\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;co