, GBP, USDC or USDT as the source. The KES amount and fee are fixed before you confirm.</span></li><li style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:grid;gap:12px;align-content:start\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:52px;line-height:1;font-weight:700;color:#7C6FFF\">03</span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em\">Delivered</span><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#4C4A66\">The payout lands on M-Pesa in Kenya. A webhook and receipt confirm delivery.</span></li></ol></section><section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px);\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px, 1.9vw + 23px, 52px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Popular routes to Kenya.</h2></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:10px;margin-top:24px\"><a href=\"/send-money-from-uk-to-kenya\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:18px;background:#fff;color:#131126\" class=\"dp-1u9awz2\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/gb.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:26px;height:18px;border-radius:3px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"><span style=\"color:#3B2ED3\">→</span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/ke.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:26px;height:18px;border-radius:3px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"></span><span><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:600\">From United Kingdom</span><span style=\"display:block;font-family:var(--font-label),mo