 alt=\"\" style=\"width:26px;height:18px;border-radius:3px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"></span><span><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:600\">USDT to KES</span><span style=\"display:block;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;color:#6E6C8A\">USDT → KES</span></span></a></div></section><section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px);\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,340px),1fr));gap:clamp(24px,4vw,56px);align-items:start\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px, 1.9vw + 23px, 52px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Payments in Kenya.</h2><div style=\"grid-column:span 2;min-width:0\"><p style=\"font-size:19px;line-height:31px;color:#2A2840;margin:0\">M-Pesa, run by Safaricom since 2007, is how most Kenyans pay and get paid, and Airtel Money is the second-largest wallet. PesaLink connects Kenyan banks in real time, which makes it the usual choice for supplier and payroll payments to bank accounts.</p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:8px;margin-top:24px\"><div style=\"padding:16px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:11px;color:#6E6C8A\">REGION</div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-top:4px\">East Africa</div></div><div style=\"padding:16px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:11px;color:#6E6C8A\">MAIN BUSINESS CITY</div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-top:4px\">Nairobi</div></div><div style=\"padding:16px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:11px;color:#6E6C8A\">DIALLING CODE</div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-top:4px\">+254</div></div><div style=\"padding:16px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:11px;color:#6E6C8A\">CURRENCY</div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-top:4px\">KES</div></div></div></div></div></section><section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px);\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,340px),1fr));gap:clamp(24px,4vw,56px);align-items:start\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px, 1.9vw + 23px, 52px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Questions about Kenya.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px;grid-column:span 2;min-width:0\"><details open=\"\" style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">How long does it take to send money to Kenya?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Most ElementPay payouts to M-Pesa in Kenya are sent on local rails as soon as you confirm, with a status for every payment.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">Which payout methods are available in Kenya?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">ElementPay pays out in KES to M-Pesa, Airtel Money, PesaLink and Bank. Mobile money payouts need the recipient’s phone number in +254 format. Bank payouts need the recipient’s account number and bank.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">Can I send money to Kenya with USDC or USDT?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Yes. Hold USDC or USDT in your ElementPay balance and use it to fund any payout to Kenya. ElementPay converts to KES at a rate shown before you confirm and delivers on the local rail.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">Can I hold KES in an ElementPay account?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Yes. ElementPay issues KES bank accounts, one per currency, so you can receive, hold and pay in Kenyan shillings.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">What currency does the recipient receive in Kenya?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Recipients in Kenya are paid in Kenyan shillings (KES). You can fund the payout from USD, EUR, GBP, any of ElementPay’s 30 account currencies, or USDC and USDT.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 24px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px\">Is ElementPay a bank?</h3><span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6F4EF;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B2ED3;flex:none;font-size:18px\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">No. ElementPay is a financial technology company. Banking services are provided by licensed partner institutions.</p></details></div></div></section><section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px);\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);letter-spacing:-0.03em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Also in East Africa.</h2><a href=\"/coverage\" style=\"font-weight:600\">All 20 countries →</a></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(min(100%,220px),1fr));gap:10px;margin-top:24px\"><a href=\"/send-money-to-uganda\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:18px;background:#fff;color:#131126\" class=\"dp-1u9awz2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/ug.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"wid